    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "...This is what Rhodes Island does. We're looking for a cure to the infection, as well as mitigating the problems associated with the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "That's right. It is not enough to only conduct research, or only try to resolve conflicts."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We must address all of the problems surrounded the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "This is the only way for Rhodes Island to give all the Infected a chance at survival..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We understand them better than most others because we, like them, are also Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "No matter who is involved or what is required, Rhodes Island seeks to put an end to the spread of hatred and disease."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, perhaps this will be your calling as well."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "...At least, this is my wish."
